(3) **User-controlled access** (e.g., one-time links, password-protected transfers);  
(4) **No storage of files beyond necessity**—immediate deletion after retrieval;  
(5) **Audit logging** of access events;  
(6) **Compliance with GDPR, FCRA, or CCPA**—including data minimization, purpose limitation, and right to withdraw consent.  

All actions must be transparent, documented, and reversible. Unauthorized access or retention violates privacy laws. Consent must be informed, specific, and revocable. This ensures ethical, lawful, and secure data handling.

